		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>This object looks just like an ordinary torch. But it’s not. It’s a torch mimic. Was there ever a trick so cruel? Just as the torch’s light fades, a wide grin opens inside the guttering flames... A stout, brightly burning torch with a terrible secret. </i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 12, <strong>HP</strong> 23, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 bite +5 (1d8 + stick), <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +2, <strong>D</strong> +0, <strong>C</strong> +1, <strong>I</strong> -2, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> -3, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 5</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Fireblood</strong>. Fire immune.</p><p></p><p><strong>Surprise</strong>. Waits to attack until there is 1 minute left on the torch timer.</p><p></p><p><strong>Stick</strong>. DC 15 STR or adhere to target; auto-hit with bite while adhered. DC 15 STR on turn to remove.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Art by Matt Morrow and Encoded Designs, LLC</i></p>",
